  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in the copper pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onions and cook until they are caramelized and golden brown.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the berbere spice and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the wild garlic leaves and cook until they are wilted.",
    "Pour in the heavy cream and bring the mixture to a simmer.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and let the Shiro sauce simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Season the sauce with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Serve the oozy caramelized Ethiopian wild garlic leaves Shiro in the copper pot."
